BO_ 839 ECM_347: 8 ECM
 SG_ Checksum : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] "" Vector__XXX

BO_ 313 Vehicle_Speed: 8 VDC
 SG_ Checksum : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] "" ECM
